---

<BaseLayout
  title="Private Investigators in Pennsylvania | KRE Security"
  description="KRE Security provides private investigations in Pennsylvania. Discuss your case with a team focused on gathering facts, evidence, and confidential information."
  headerVariant="transparent"
>
  <main data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:9nyb11">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="bg-dark-background pt-32 pb-20 relative overflow-hidden" id="pi-hero" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:y6brye">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wdd">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wdz">
          <div data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7we0">
            <span class="text-primary font-display font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mb-6 block" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhytl">
              [ Dispatch Status: Active ]
            </span>
            <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-h1 text-dark-foreground uppercase tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:3stqs0">
              Qualified Pennsylvania Private Investigators &amp; Process Services
            </h1>
            <p class="font-sans text-dark-muted-foreground text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:wi9b36">
              Our professional private investigators use a number of surveillance and investigative techniques to gather accurate information on any subject or situation in question.
            </p>
            <p class="font-sans text-dark-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-8" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:wi9b35">
              Our private investigators have a keen eye, excellent observation skills, and an analytical mind to uncover facts and evidence for our valued customers. We perform cases locally and nationally.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7we1">
              <a
                href="/#contact"
                class="inline-block bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-display font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest px-8 py-4 border-2 border-primary hover:bg-primary-hover transition-colors duration-150"
               data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:pebefx">
                Contact Us to Get Started
              </a>
              <a
                href="tel:6105620971"
                class="inline-block bg-transparent text-dark-foreground font-display font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest px-8 py-4 border-2 border-dark-border hover:border-primary hover:text-primary transition-colors duration-150"
               data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:pebefw">
                610-562-0971
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Support Card Aside -->
          <aside
            class="kre-support bg-[#102032] border border-[#dbab00]/25 rounded-[20px] p-6 lg:p-8"
            aria-labelledby="support-title"
           data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:17qwpi">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7we2">
              <div class="w-12 h-14 flex-shrink-0" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7we3">
                <img
                  src="https://pagesmith-cdn.com/fe6bcc20/images/kre-security-gold-logo-670a49-1024.webp"
                  alt="KRE Security"
                  width="1024"
                  height="1226"
                  class="w-full h-full object-contain" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1017yb" />
              </div>
              <div data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7we4">
                <span class="text-[#dba400] text-xs font-bold tracking-[1.28px] uppercase block mb-1" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhytk">
                  KRE SECURITY, LLC
                </span>
                <h2 id="support-title" class="text-white font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-1" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:avl6g8">
                  How can we help?
                </h2>
                <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-sm flex items-center gap-2" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:wi9b34">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#dba400] inline-block" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhytj"></span>
                  24-hour emergency dispatch
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7we5">
              <a
                href="/act-67-certified-services/"
                class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.086] rounded-xl p-3.5 flex items-center justify-between hover:bg-primary/[0.06] hover:border-primary/50 transition-all text-white group"
               data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:pebefv">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7we6">
                  <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhyti">◇</span>
                  <div data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7we7">
                    <strong class="font-display text-sm font-bold block text-white">Act 67 Training</strong>
                    <small class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-xs block">School security training and certification</small>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-primary text-sm font-bold ml-3 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhyth">↗</span>
              </a>

              <a
                href="/first-aid-training/"
                class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.086] rounded-xl p-3.5 flex items-center justify-between hover:bg-primary/[0.06] hover:border-primary/50 transition-all text-white group"
               data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:pebefu">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7we8">
                  <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhytg">+</span>
                  <div data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7weu">
                    <strong class="font-display text-sm font-bold block text-white">First Aid Training</strong>
                    <small class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-xs block">Explore our first aid training programs</small>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-primary text-sm font-bold ml-3 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhytf">↗</span>
              </a>

              <a
                href="tel:610-562-0971"
                class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.086] rounded-xl p-3.5 flex items-center justify-between hover:bg-primary/[0.06] hover:border-primary/50 transition-all text-white group"
               data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:pebef8">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wev">
                  <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhyst">◷</span>
                  <div data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wew">
                    <strong class="font-display text-sm font-bold block text-white">24-hour emergency dispatch</strong>
                    <small class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-xs block">610-562-0971</small>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-primary text-sm font-bold ml-3 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhyss">↗</span>
              </a>

              <a
                href="/employment/"
                class="bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.086] rounded-xl p-3.5 flex items-center justify-between hover:bg-primary/[0.06] hover:border-primary/50 transition-all text-white group"
               data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:pebef7">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wex">
                  <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-primary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-sm" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhysr">+</span>
                  <div data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wey">
                    <strong class="font-display text-sm font-bold block text-white">KRE Job Openings</strong>
                    <small class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-xs block">Explore careers with KRE Security</small>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="text-primary text-sm font-bold ml-3 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhysq">↗</span>
              </a>
            </div>

            <p class="text-dark-muted-foreground text-xs text-center mt-6" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:wi9b33">
              Your total security professional.
            </p>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Client Base Section -->
    <section class="bg-surface py-16" id="pi-clients" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:y6bryf">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wez">
        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wf0">
          <div data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wf1">
            <p class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-3" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:wi9b2h">
              [ Client Base ]
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-h3 text-foreground uppercase tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:avl6g7">
              Diverse Clientele, Tailored Investigations
            </h2>
            <p class="font-sans text-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:wi9b2g">
              Our firm specializes and handles numerous types of investigations with various scenarios. All casework is performed based on each client's needs.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-8" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wf2">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-background border border-border" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wf3">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-primary flex-shrink-0" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhysp"></span>
                <span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-foreground uppercase tracking-wide" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhyso">Private Citizens</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-background border border-border" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wfp">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-primary flex-shrink-0" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhysn"></span>
                <span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-foreground uppercase tracking-wide" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhysm">Attorneys</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-background border border-border" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wfq">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-primary flex-shrink-0" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhysl"></span>
                <span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-foreground uppercase tracking-wide" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhysk">Processing Services</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-3 bg-background border border-border" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wfr">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-primary flex-shrink-0" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhyry"></span>
                <span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-foreground uppercase tracking-wide" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhyrx">Corporate Investigation</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Tactical Frame Gallery -->
          <div class="tactical-frame bg-background p-8 relative" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wfs">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-primary -translate-x-px -translate-y-px" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wft"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-primary translate-x-px translate-y-px" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wfu"></div>
            <p class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-4" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:wi9b2f">
              [ Investigation Gallery ]
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wfv">
              {
                galleryItems.map((item, __psIdx) => (
                  <div class="relative overflow-hidden aspect-square group" data-ps={`src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wfw-${__psIdx}`}>
                    <img
                      src={item.image}
                      alt={item.alt}
                      class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                      loading="lazy" data-ps={`src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1017ya-${__psIdx}`} />
                    <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/40 to-transparent pt-4 pb-1 px-1.5 text-center" data-ps={`src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wfx-${__psIdx}`}>
                      <span class="font-sans text-[11px] leading-tight font-medium text-white block" data-ps={`src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhyrw-${__psIdx}`}>
                        {item.title}
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                ))
              }
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Investigation Types Section -->
    <section class="bg-background py-20" id="pi-services" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:y6bryg">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1i7wfy">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:w12qk6">
          <p class="font-display text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground mb-3" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:wi9b2e">
            [ Investigation Types ]
          </p>
          <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-h2 text-foreground uppercase tracking-tight leading-tight mb-4" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:avl6g6">
            Providing Private Investigation Services For The Following:
          </h2>
          <p class="font-sans text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:wi9b2d">
            Our comprehensive investigation capabilities span local and national cases, tailored to each client's specific needs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 72 Investigation Services Grid -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-2 mb-16" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:w12qk5">
          {
            serviceTypes.map((type, __psIdx) => (
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2 p-3 border border-border bg-surface hover:border-primary hover:bg-background transition-colors duration-150 group" data-ps={`src/pages/private-investigations.astro:w12qk4-${__psIdx}`}>
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-primary flex-shrink-0 group-hover:shadow-[0_0_6px_var(--color-primary)]" data-ps={`src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhyrv-${__psIdx}`}></span>
                <span class="font-sans text-xs text-foreground" data-ps={`src/pages/private-investigations.astro:xkhyru-${__psIdx}`}>{type}</span>
              </div>
            ))
          }
        </div>

        <!-- 9 Square Image Strip -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 md:grid-cols-5 lg:grid-cols-9 gap-2 mb-12" data-ps="src/pages/private-investigations.astro:w12qk3">
          {
            stripItems.map((item, __psIdx) => (
              <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden border border-border relative group" data-ps={`src/pages/private-investigations.astro:w12qk2-${__psIdx}`}>
                <img
                  src={item.image}
                  alt={item.alt}
                  class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300"
                  loading="lazy" data-ps={`src/pages/private-investigations.astro:1017y9-${__psIdx}`} />
                <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-black/40 to-transparent pt-3 pb-1 px-1 text-center" data-ps={`src/pages/private-investigations.astro:w12qk1-${__psIdx}`}>
